eResistance":34.5},"t":{"o":"Health governs how much passive Flinch Resistance you have while aiming down sights (ADS) and how much health collecting Orbs of Power restores.\n\nWhen enhanced, it increases the Recharge Rate of your Shields in all activities, as well as their total HP in PvE activities.","b":"Grants you {{FlinchResistance}}{{Percent}} Flinch Resistance while ADS and makes Orbs of Power restore {{OrbOfPowerHealthRestore}}{{HP}} on pickup.\n\nYour Health has {{PVEDamageResistance}}{{Percent}} Damage Resistance against combatants in PvE. (Health is the left side portion of your HP bar)\n\nYour Health starts regenerating {{HealthRegenDelay}}{{Time}} after taking damage, at a rate of {{HealthRegenSpeed}}{{PercentPerSecond}}. Your Health has {{PVPHealthHP}}{{HP}} in most PVP activities and {{PVEHealthHP}}{{HP}} in PVE activities.\n\nYour Shields start recharging {{BaseShieldRechargeDelay}}{{Time}} after taking damage, at a rate of {{BaseShieldRechargeSpeed}}{{PercentPerSecond}}. Your Shields have {{BaseShieldHP}}{{HP}}.","e":"Grants you {{FlinchResistance}}{{Percent}} Flinch Resistance while aiming down sights and makes Orbs of Power restore {{OrbOfPowerHealthRestore}}{{HP}} on pickup.\n\nYour Health has {{PVEDamageResistance}}{{Percent}} Damage Resistance against combatants in PvE.\n\nYour Health starts regenerating {{HealthRegenDelay}}{{Time}} after taking damage, at a rate of {{HealthRegenSpeed}}{{PercentPerSecond}}. Your Health has {{PVPHealthHP}}{{HP}} in most PVP activities and {{PVEHealthHP}}{{HP}} in PVE activities.\n\n{{Enhancement}} Your Shields start recharging {{ShieldRechargeDelay}}{{Time}} after taking damage, at a rate of {{ShieldRechargeSpeed}}{{PercentPerSecond}}. Your Shields have {{BaseShieldHP}}{{HP}}, plus {{PVEBonusShieldHP}}{{HP}} in PVE activities."}},"Class":{"hash":1943323491,"f":{"CooldownScalars":[0,[1,0.9998,0.999,0.9978,0.9961,0.994,0.9913,0.9883,0.9848,0.9809,0.9765,0.9718,0.9667,0.9612,0.9554,0.9493,0.9429,0.9361,0.9291,0.921